        "original_id": "aca34d20-b501-5faf-930b-9f3060d72f97",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Disturbia\n- People: D. J. Caruso, Christopher Landon, Carl Ellsworth, Shia LaBeouf, David Morse, Sarah Roemer, Carrie-Anne Moss\n- Topics: Shia LaBeouf's career\n\nFacts:\n- Shia LaBeouf was born on June 11, 1986, and he is an American actor, performance artist, and filmmaker.\n- In 2001, Shia LaBeouf received a Young Artist Award nomination for playing Louis Stevens in the Disney Channel series Even Stevens.\n- In 2003, Shia LaBeouf won a Daytime Emmy Award for playing Louis Stevens in the Disney Channel series Even Stevens.\n- Disturbia is a 2007 American horror thriller film directed by D. J. Caruso and written by Christopher Landon and Carl Ellsworth.\n- Disturbia stars Shia LaBeouf, David Morse, Sarah Roemer, and Carrie-Anne Moss.",
